safix: the mapping 'ntfy-token' exports ntfy-token for alice, which holds no value yet.

secrets/safix/users/alice/secrets.yaml does not carry the key. Evaluation could not have caught this: an
entry declares where a value lives, not that one is there, and the two
are the same declaration until something reads the file.

Put a value there first:

    safix set alice ntfy-token

or, if a generator should mint it, declare one and run:

    safix generate alice ntfy-token
